mindmap
  root((Galip Usta - GU v1))
    What it is
      WhatsApp-native shop-floor record
      Compliance plus benchmark layer
      Usta is the sensor - phone is the UI
      No install - no sensors
      Thin layer on EAIP platform
    Personas
      Ustabasi - capturer on WhatsApp
      Patron - value and buyer - dashboard
      Office Excel person - secondary capturer
      OEM quality manager - demand-side
    Problem
      Data in paper and on the floor
      No IT - no MES - no sensors - no CapEx
      IATF audit pressure from OEM
      Emerging CBAM and carbon requests
    Capabilities
      Frictionless capture
        Photo - notebook and HMI counter
        Voice - Whisper STT
        Interactive buttons
      Confirm and integrity loop
      Daily karne - aggregated and actionable
      Flow and bottleneck - TOC
      IATF audit armor - one-click PDF
      Cross-tenant benchmark
      Carbon CBAM extension - Pro
      Manager dashboard - mobile web
      Progressive enhancement by granularity
    Packaging
      Core - adet plus fire - karne - benchmark
      Pro - rework - sarf - flow - energy - CBAM
      Subscription is data-acquisition cost
      Real revenue is multi-sided
    Architecture on EAIP
      Channel Gateway plus WhatsApp
      LangGraph agent
      Whisper STT
      Vision via vLLM and LiteLLM
      PostgreSQL multi-tenant
      ClickHouse - analytics and benchmark
      FalkorDB and Graphiti - graph
      MinIO - Kong - Keycloak - WeasyPrint
      Dashboard on Next.js - existing infra
      Sensors later - IoT-Ignite and TimescaleDB
    Moat
      Cross-tenant operational dataset
      Data network effect - contribute to see
      IATF and verification credibility
      OEM relationships
      Cloud-tier IPR - physics not contract
    Strategy and FBH
      Beachhead - fastener SME
      Geography - TR lab
      IATF primary - CBAM emerging
      Channel - BESIAD or OEM anchor
      Globally portable formula
    Non-goals
      Not sensor or IoT in v1
      Not MES or ERP
      Not a dashboard for the usta
      Not verification-grade on self-report
    Open questions
      Anchor OEM - blocker
      OEE karne-text data source
      CN 7318 CBAM scope
      Energy metering approach
      Capture-extraction quality - key risk
      Dashboard role-set and multi-shop
